  "body": "Welcome to a truly exceptional opportunity—nestled within one of Gulf Harbour’s most prestigious gated communities. This 830m² (more or less) site offers you the chance to create a truly exceptional home and take full advantage of stunning views across the sparkling Hauraki Gulf.\r\n\r\nThis remarkable site offers a unique blend of elevation, privacy, and panoramic outlook—an enticing foundation for your bespoke coastal masterpiece. Few sections offer such a harmonious balance of space, serenity, and sweeping views, all within a secure and exclusive community that embodies peace of mind.\r\n\r\nEnjoy the perfect balance of seclusion and convenience. Located just moments from the vibrant retail and dining precincts of Silverdale and Stanmore Bay, residents also benefit from easy access to ferry services into Auckland City, charming local cafés, and the natural splendor of Shakespear Regional Park—renowned for its scenic walking trails and abundant birdlife.\r\n\r\nContact us today for more information or to arrange your private viewing and take the first step toward the lifestyle you deserve.",
